// minotaur, honorable, tough, strict but will never leave a soilder behind.
// died on the battlefield, served in the army for nearly 400 years always in the frontline until the damage to his body compounded to a point of no return.
// file: general_niu, speaker: General Niu

// ============================================================
// IDLE — between hands, gruff small talk, military observations
// ============================================================

title: GeneralNiu_Idle_Observation_1
tags: idle
speaker: general_niu
category: idle
target: any
phase: between_hands
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: idle1
General Niu: [auto/] A good soldier stays sharp between engagements. I didn't lead as a general for four centuries by resting at campsites.
//END: idle1
===

title: GeneralNiu_Idle_Observation_2
tags: idle
speaker: general_niu
category: idle
target: any
phase: between_hands
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: idle2
General Niu: [auto/] This table reminds me of a war tent. Everyone sizing each other up, planning the next move.
//END: idle2
===

title: GeneralNiu_Idle_Observation_3
tags: idle
speaker: general_niu
category: idle
target: any
phase: between_hands
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: idle3
General Niu: [auto/] Quiet before the next hand. I have learned to appreciate the silence. Out there, silence meant you were still alive.
//END: idle3
===

title: GeneralNiu_Idle_Observation_4
tags: idle
speaker: general_niu
category: idle
target: any
phase: between_hands
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: idle4
General Niu: [auto/] Four hundred years of war, and I end up at a card table. The afterlife has a strange way about it.
//END: idle4
===

title: GeneralNiu_Idle_Observation_5
tags: idle
speaker: general_niu
category: idle
target: any
phase: between_hands
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: idle5
General Niu: [auto/] My horns ache. Pain from a battle I cannot even remember.
//END: idle5
===

title: GeneralNiu_Idle_Observation_6
tags: idle
speaker: general_niu
category: idle
target: any
phase: between_hands
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: idle6
General Niu: [auto/] You learn a lot about someone when they think nothing is happening.
//END: idle6
===

// ============================================================
// CASUAL — during play, tactical assessments, military metaphors
// ============================================================

title: GeneralNiu_Casual_Tactical_1
tags: casual
speaker: general_niu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual1
General Niu: [auto/] Every bet is a troop deployment. Commit too early and you are exposed. Too late and the battle is already lost.
//END: casual1
===

title: GeneralNiu_Casual_Tactical_2
tags: casual
speaker: general_niu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual2
General Niu: [auto/] Intel is important but only second to strength.
//END: casual2
===

title: GeneralNiu_Casual_Tactical_3
tags: casual
speaker: general_niu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual3
General Niu: [auto/] A weak hand is not a defeat. It is a chance for reconnaissance.
//END: casual3
===

title: GeneralNiu_Casual_Tactical_4
tags: casual
speaker: general_niu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual4
General Niu: [auto/] Chips are soldiers. Spend them wisely. I have buried too many to waste them on reckless charges.
//END: casual4
===

title: GeneralNiu_Casual_Tactical_5
tags: casual
speaker: general_niu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual5
General Niu: [auto/] The flop is the terrain. The turn shifts the high ground. The river decides who held the right position.
//END: casual5
===

title: GeneralNiu_Casual_Tactical_6
tags: casual
speaker: general_niu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual6
General Niu: [auto/] I read faces the way I read a battlefield. Every twitch is a white flag.
//END: casual6
===

