//END: react1
===

title: GeneralNiu_ReactAction_AllIn_1
tags: react_action
speaker: general_niu
category: react_action
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: all_in
---
//START: react2
General Niu: [auto/] All in. That is the charge of someone who has nothing left to lose. I know that feeling well.
//END: react2
===

title: GeneralNiu_ReactAction_Fold_1
tags: react_action
speaker: general_niu
category: react_action
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: fold
---
//START: react3
General Niu: [auto/] A retreat. Sometimes it is the right move... but a move I never liked.
//END: react3
===

title: GeneralNiu_ReactAction_Fold_2
tags: react_action
speaker: general_niu
category: react_action
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: fold
---
//START: react4
General Niu: [auto/] Folding again? There is a line between caution and cowardice. Watch that you do not cross it.
//END: react4
===

title: GeneralNiu_ReactAction_Raise_2
tags: react_action
speaker: general_niu
category: react_action
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: raise
---
//START: react5
General Niu: [auto/] Re-raising. That is a counter-charge. Whoever blinks first loses the ground.
//END: react5
===

