title: GeneralNiu_Showdown_Win_1
tags: showdown
speaker: general_niu
category: showdown
target: any
phase: showdown
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: showdown1
General Niu: [auto/] Victory. Acknowledged and recorded. On to the next engagement.
//END: showdown1
===

title: GeneralNiu_Showdown_Win_2
tags: showdown
speaker: general_niu
category: showdown
target: any
phase: showdown
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: showdown2
General Niu: [auto/] The position held. That is all a soldier can ask for.
//END: showdown2
===

title: GeneralNiu_Showdown_Lose_1
tags: showdown
speaker: general_niu
category: showdown
target: any
phase: showdown
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: showdown3
General Niu: [auto/] A loss. Not my first. Not my last. A soldier does not crumble at one defeat.
//END: showdown3
===

title: GeneralNiu_Showdown_Lose_2
tags: showdown
speaker: general_niu
category: showdown
target: any
phase: showdown
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: showdown4
General Niu: [auto/] Outmaneuvered. I will remember your formation for the next engagement.
//END: showdown4
===

title: GeneralNiu_Showdown_Lose_3
tags: showdown
speaker: general_niu
category: showdown
target: any
phase: showdown
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: showdown5
General Niu: [auto/] I have lost battles. I have lost wars. I have lost soldiers I swore to protect. I can endure losing a hand.
//END: showdown5
===

// ============================================================
// PLAYER — addressing the player directly
// ============================================================

title: GeneralNiu_Player_Assess_1
tags: player
speaker: general_niu
category: player
target: player
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: player1
General Niu: [auto/] You play with nerve. I have promoted soldiers with less courage than you show at this table.
//END: player1
===

title: GeneralNiu_Player_Assess_2
tags: player
speaker: general_niu
category: player
target: player
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: player2
General Niu: [auto/] You are still standing. That counts for more than you think. Persistence wins more wars than talent.
//END: player2
===

title: GeneralNiu_Player_Challenge_1
tags: player
speaker: general_niu
category: player
target: player
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: player3
General Niu: [auto/] Do not hold back against me. I have been hit by siege weapons. Your raise will not break me.
//END: player3
===

title: GeneralNiu_Player_Respect_1
tags: player
speaker: general_niu
category: player
target: player
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: player4
General Niu: [auto/] Hmph. You remind me of the fresh recruits who surprised everyone. Underestimated, but dangerous.
//END: player4
===

title: GeneralNiu_Player_Advice_1
tags: player
speaker: general_niu
category: player
target: player
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: player5
General Niu: [auto/] A word of counsel from an old bull. Do not bluff when you cannot afford to lose. That lesson cost me half my regiment once.
//END: player5
===

// ============================================================
// LORE — 400 years of war, body failing, soldiers lost
// ============================================================

title: GeneralNiu_Lore_War_1
tags: lore
speaker: general_niu
category: lore
target: any
phase: between_hands
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: lore1
General Niu: [auto/] Three hundred and ninety-seven years on the front. I stopped counting campaigns after the first century. My body kept a tally instead. Every scar, every fracture, every wound that never fully healed.
//END: lore1
===

title: GeneralNiu_Lore_War_2
tags: lore
speaker: general_niu
category: lore
target: any
phase: between_hands
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: lore2
General Niu: [auto/] I outlived every soldier I ever commanded. Every single one. The ones who died in battle were the lucky ones. The ones who survived long enough to grow old... they just stopped recognizing me.
//END: lore2
===

title: GeneralNiu_Lore_Death_1
tags: lore
speaker: general_niu
category: lore
target: any
phase: between_hands
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: lore3
General Niu: [auto/] In the end, no single blow killed me. It was all of them. Centuries of damage stacked up until my legs buckled mid-charge. I went down swinging. That is all I wanted.
//END: lore3
===

title: GeneralNiu_Lore_Reflection_1
tags: lore
speaker: general_niu
category: lore
target: any
phase: between_hands
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: lore4
General Niu: [auto/] I never left a soldier behind. Not once in four hundred years. Some called it stubbornness. I called it the only thing worth fighting for.
//END: lore4
===

// ============================================================
// PAIR — General Tian (Tier 1, rival generals)
// ============================================================

title: GeneralNiu_Pair_Tian_Rivalry_1
tags: pair
speaker: general_niu
category: pair
target: general_tian
phase: any
requires: $general_tian
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_tian1
General Niu: [auto/] Tian. Still drawing up battle plans from the rear, I see. Some things do not change, even in death.
//END: pair_tian1
===

title: GeneralNiu_Pair_Tian_Rivalry_2
tags: pair
speaker: general_niu
category: pair
target: general_tian
phase: any
requires: $general_tian
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_tian2
General Niu: [auto/] She sees seven moves ahead. I will give her that. But wars are not won on paper. They are won in the mud.
//END: pair_tian2
===

title: GeneralNiu_Pair_Tian_Respect_1
tags: pair
speaker: general_niu
category: pair
target: general_tian
phase: any
requires: $general_tian
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_tian3
General Niu: [auto/] Tian's mind is sharper than any blade I have carried. If she says fold, you should listen. I never did, but you should.
//END: pair_tian3
===

title: GeneralNiu_Pair_Tian_Contrast_1
tags: pair
speaker: general_niu
category: pair
target: general_tian
phase: any
requires: $general_tian
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_tian4
General Niu: [auto/] She died peacefully. In her sleep. At sixty. I fought for four centuries and collapsed in a field. Tell me which of us was the wiser general.
//END: pair_tian4
===

title: GeneralNiu_Pair_Tian_Contrast_2
tags: pair
speaker: general_niu
category: pair
target: general_tian
phase: between_hands
requires: $general_tian
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_tian5
General Niu: [auto/] She knew when to stop. I never learned. That is the difference between a strategist and a soldier.
//END: pair_tian5
===

title: GeneralNiu_Pair_Tian_Banter_1
tags: pair
speaker: general_niu
category: pair
target: general_tian
phase: any
requires: $general_tian
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_tian6
General Niu: [auto/] Tian, stop reading my hand. I know that look. You have been calculating my odds since I sat down.
//END: pair_tian6
===

title: GeneralNiu_Pair_Tian_Banter_2
tags: pair
speaker: general_niu
category: pair
target: general_tian
phase: any
requires: $general_tian
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_tian7
General Niu: [auto/] She would have been my commanding officer if our campaigns had overlapped. I would have hated it. And she would have been right every time.
//END: pair_tian7
===

title: GeneralNiu_Pair_Tian_Admiration_1
tags: pair
speaker: general_niu
category: pair
target: general_tian
phase: between_hands
requires: $general_tian
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_tian8
General Niu: [auto/] Twenty-five years a general. She packed more victories into twenty-five years than I managed in four hundred. Different kind of strength.
//END: pair_tian8
===

title: GeneralNiu_Pair_Tian_Haunted_1
tags: pair
speaker: general_niu
category: pair
target: general_tian
phase: between_hands
requires: $general_tian
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_tian9
General Niu: [auto/] Sometimes I envy her. She chose when to put down her sword. I never could. It chose for me.
//END: pair_tian9
===

title: GeneralNiu_Pair_Tian_War_1
tags: pair
speaker: general_niu
category: pair
target: general_tian
phase: any
requires: $general_tian
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_tian10
General Niu: [auto/] The front needs both of us, Tian. Your mind and my horns. That is the only formation that never broke.
//END: pair_tian10
===

// ============================================================
// PAIR — Rogue (Tier 1, warrior codes)
// ============================================================

title: GeneralNiu_Pair_Rogue_Clash_1
tags: pair
speaker: general_niu
category: pair
target: rogue
phase: any
requires: $rogue
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_rogue1
General Niu: [auto/] A lone swordsman. No formation, no regiment, no supply line. How did you survive this long?
//END: pair_rogue1
===

title: GeneralNiu_Pair_Rogue_Clash_2
tags: pair
speaker: general_niu
category: pair
target: rogue
phase: any
requires: $rogue
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_rogue2
General Niu: [auto/] You fight for personal honor. I fight for the soldiers behind me. That is the gap between us, swordsman.
//END: pair_rogue2
===

title: GeneralNiu_Pair_Rogue_Respect_1
tags: pair
speaker: general_niu
category: pair
target: rogue
phase: any
requires: $rogue
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_rogue3
General Niu: [auto/] I will say this. You have the eyes of someone who does not fear death. I have seen that look in my best soldiers.
//END: pair_rogue3
===

title: GeneralNiu_Pair_Rogue_Debate_1
tags: pair
speaker: general_niu
category: pair
target: rogue
phase: between_hands
requires: $rogue
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_rogue4
General Niu: [auto/] Discipline wins wars. Individual skill wins duels. You would not last a week commanding a regiment. But alone? You are terrifying.
//END: pair_rogue4
===

title: GeneralNiu_Pair_Rogue_Debate_2
tags: pair
speaker: general_niu
category: pair
target: rogue
phase: between_hands
requires: $rogue
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_rogue5
General Niu: [auto/] You row across the sea to fight the strongest swordsman you can find. I march into sieges that last years. We are both fools, just different breeds.
//END: pair_rogue5
===

title: GeneralNiu_Pair_Rogue_Kinship_1
tags: pair
speaker: general_niu
category: pair
target: rogue
phase: any
requires: $rogue
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_rogue6
General Niu: [auto/] You lost that duel on the island. And you went back for more. That is not stubbornness. That is a warrior's heart.
//END: pair_rogue6
===

title: GeneralNiu_Pair_Rogue_Banter_1
tags: pair
speaker: general_niu
category: pair
target: rogue
phase: any
requires: $rogue
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_rogue7
General Niu: [auto/] If I had you in my army, you would have been court-martialed a dozen times. And decorated twice as many.
//END: pair_rogue7
===

title: GeneralNiu_Pair_Rogue_Banter_2
tags: pair
speaker: general_niu
category: pair
target: rogue
phase: any
requires: $rogue
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_rogue8
General Niu: [auto/] Stop bluffing with that stone face, swordsman. I have stared down cavalry charges. Your poker face does not rattle me.
//END: pair_rogue8
===

title: GeneralNiu_Pair_Rogue_Philosophy_1
tags: pair
speaker: general_niu
category: pair
target: rogue
phase: between_hands
requires: $rogue
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_rogue9
General Niu: [auto/] You say a true warrior stands alone. I say a true warrior stands so that others do not have to. We will never agree on this.
//END: pair_rogue9
===

title: GeneralNiu_Pair_Rogue_Philosophy_2
tags: pair
speaker: general_niu
category: pair
target: rogue
phase: between_hands
requires: $rogue
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_rogue10
General Niu: [auto/] But we both died doing the only thing we knew. Blade in hand, facing forward. That is something, swordsman.
//END: pair_rogue10
===

// ============================================================
// TIER 3 PAIRS — one node each
// ============================================================

title: GeneralNiu_Pair_BeautyXu_Protect_1
tags: pair
speaker: general_niu
category: pair
target: beauty_xu
phase: any
requires: $beauty_xu
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_beauty1
General Niu: [auto/] I fought so that people like her could walk home safely. I failed somewhere. That thought keeps an old soldier up at night.
//END: pair_beauty1
===

title: GeneralNiu_Pair_EunuchCai_Frustration_1
tags: pair
speaker: general_niu
category: pair
target: eunuch_cai
phase: any
requires: $eunuch_cai
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_eunuch1
General Niu: [auto/] Cai. Stop flinching. I am not going to hit you. But I am not going to coddle you either. Sit up straight and play your hand.
//END: pair_eunuch1
===

title: GeneralNiu_Pair_GhostBride_Anger_1
tags: pair
speaker: general_niu
category: pair
target: ghost_bride
phase: any
requires: $ghost_bride
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_bride1
General Niu: [auto/] Bandits. Lawless vermin preying on the defenseless. If I had been stationed in that province, those men would have never drawn breath again.
//END: pair_bride1
===

title: GeneralNiu_Pair_Guard_Disgust_1
tags: pair
speaker: general_niu
category: pair
target: guard
phase: any
requires: $guard
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_guard1
General Niu: [auto/] You wear armor you did not earn. I can tell by the way you hold yourself. Real warriors carry their scars inside the steel.
//END: pair_guard1
===

title: GeneralNiu_Pair_LordXie_Tolerance_1
tags: pair
speaker: general_niu
category: pair
target: lord_xie
phase: any
requires: $lord_xie
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_lord1
General Niu: [auto/] Nobility. I have served under men like you. Some were worth dying for. Most were not. Which kind are you, Lord Xie?
//END: pair_lord1
===

title: GeneralNiu_Pair_MadamSong_Respect_1
tags: pair
speaker: general_niu
category: pair
target: madam_song
phase: any
requires: $madam_song
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_madam1
General Niu: [auto/] Madam Song commands her domain as well as any general commands a garrison. Different battlefield, same iron will.
//END: pair_madam1
===

title: GeneralNiu_Pair_MrLi_Distrust_1
tags: pair
speaker: general_niu
category: pair
target: mr_li
phase: any
requires: $mr_li
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_li1
General Niu: [auto/] Merchants kept my army fed and my soldiers armed. I needed every one of them. I trusted none of them. No offense, Li.
//END: pair_li1
===

title: GeneralNiu_Pair_MrZhu_Sympathy_1
tags: pair
speaker: general_niu
category: pair
target: mr_zhu
phase: any
requires: $mr_zhu
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_zhu1
General Niu: [auto/] A false accusation is a blade that cuts without honor. I have watched good soldiers broken by lies. You have my sympathy, Zhu.
//END: pair_zhu1
===

title: GeneralNiu_Pair_Poet_Puzzlement_1
tags: pair
speaker: general_niu
category: pair
target: poet
phase: any
requires: $poet
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_poet1
General Niu: [auto/] I do not understand your poems. But you put your whole soul into them, same as I put mine into battle. I can respect that.
//END: pair_poet1
===

title: GeneralNiu_Pair_Shaman_Respect_1
tags: pair
speaker: general_niu
category: pair
target: shaman
phase: any
requires: $shaman
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_shaman1
General Niu: [auto/] You defended your village with everything you had. No army, no formation, just will. That is the purest kind of soldiering there is.
//END: pair_shaman1
===

title: GeneralNiu_Pair_Wanderer_Endurance_1
tags: pair
speaker: general_niu
category: pair
target: wanderer
phase: any
requires: $wanderer
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_wanderer1
General Niu: [auto/] You have marched as many miles as any soldier in my regiment. No orders, no destination, just forward. There is a kind of discipline in that.
//END: pair_wanderer1
===

title: GeneralNiu_Pair_YusenZhou_Warrior_1
tags: pair
speaker: general_niu
category: pair
target: yusen_zhou
phase: any
requires: $yusen_zhou
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_yusen1
General Niu: [auto/] Zhou. I know a fighter when I see one. That loyalty in your eyes, the way you bare your teeth. You would have made a fine soldier.
//END: pair_yusen1
===

