---
//START: trio_warriors1
General Niu: [auto/] A strategist, a duelist, and a frontline bull at the same table. Between the three of us, we could conquer any battlefield. Too bad we are stuck playing cards.
//END: trio_warriors1
===

title: GeneralNiu_Trio_Warriors_2
tags: trio
speaker: general_niu
category: trio
target: any
phase: between_hands
requires: $general_tian and $rogue
priority: 4
---
//START: trio_warriors2
General Niu: [auto/] Tian plans the war. The swordsman fights the duel. I hold the line. Three philosophies of combat, and none of us will budge. This should be an interesting game.
//END: trio_warriors2
===

// ============================================================
// REACT_ACTION — Self-reactions (General Niu reacting to his own play)
// ============================================================

title: GeneralNiu_ReactAction_SelfFold_01
tags: react_action
speaker: general_niu
category: react_action
target: self
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: fold
---
//START: self_fold1
General Niu: [auto/] I fold. Even a general knows when the position is not worth holding.
//END: self_fold1
